#: hmib_types.php
msgid "The Host Type is determined by scanning its snmp agent for the sysObjectID and sysDescription and comparing it against values in the Host Types database.  The first match that is found in the database is used aggregate Host data.  Therefore, it is very important that you select valid sysObjectID, sysDescrMatch for your Hosts."
msgstr "A na-ekpebi Ụdị Onye nnabata site n'inyocha onye nnọchi anya snmp ya maka sysObjectID na sysDescription ma tụnyere ya na ọnụ ahịa dị na nchekwa data Ụdị Onye nnabata.  A na-eji ndakọrịta mbụ a hụrụ na nchekwa data chịkọta data Onye nnabata.  Ya mere, ọ dị ezigbo mkpa ka ị họrọ sysObjectID, sysDescrMatch ziri ezi maka Ndị nnabata gị."

